{"id":"crime","lemma":"crime","pos":"noun","rank":540,"glosses":["a category of severe offences within French law, comparable to a felony under United States laws. Crime are tied to the strongest of penalties, 10 years and more according to law."],"ipa":"/kʁim/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/00/Fr-crime.ogg/Fr-crime.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"crimes"},"formAudio":{"crimes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-crimes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le meurtre est un crime.","en":"Murder is a crime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1098088","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"murder"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Depuis quand est-ce un crime ?","en":"Since when is that a crime?","words":[{"g":"since"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il est innocent du crime.","en":"He is innocent of the crime.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"an innocent person"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Quels crimes as-tu commis ?","en":"What crimes have you committed?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},null,{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"clerk"}]},{"text":"Ils lui pardonnèrent ses crimes.","en":"They forgave him for his crimes.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"to pardon, forgive","l":"pardonner"},{"g":"his"},null]}]}